    185          /*
    186          *******************************************************************
    187          * Title:		void	Eep_Read_FixValue(FixValueBuff *pReadFixvalBuff)
    188          * Description:		读某一定值区定值
    189          * InputParameter:	FixValueBuff *pReadFixvalBuff <定值区缓冲指针>
